    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HWP Estate Agents are excited to introduce No. 19 Carrigmore Downs to the residential property market. No. 19 is an impressive and well-maintained four-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally positioned within a mature and sought-after residential development in Saggart, Dublin 24. This property has been enhanced by a rear extension, providing additional living space suited to the demands of modern living.\n\nThe accommodation is well-proportioned throughout. At ground floor level, a welcoming entrance hallway leads to a bright living room and an extended kitchen/dining area, offering an excellent space for both everyday use and entertaining. A conveniently located utility room is situated just off the kitchen, adding to the practicality of the layout.\n\nAt first floor level, there are four bedrooms. The principal bedroom benefits from an ensuite bathroom and built-in wardrobes. Two further double bedrooms also include built-in wardrobes, while the fourth bedroom is a single room, suitable for use as a home office, nursery, or study. A main bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nExternally, the property features a low-maintenance paved rear garden, providing a private outdoor space and private driveway to the front.\n\nCarrigmore Downs is a highly regarded residential development, due to its convenient setting and strong sense of community. The property is located within close proximity to Saggart Village, which offers a range of local amenities including shops, cafes, restaurants, and essential services.\n\nThe area is particularly well served by educational facilities, with a selection of primary and secondary schools nearby. Recreational amenities are also abundant, including local parks, playgrounds, and sporting clubs. The nearby Citywest area further enhances the offering with additional retail outlets, business parks, and leisure facilities.\n\nThe property benefits from excellent transport connectivity. The Red Line Luas at Saggart and Citywest provides direct access to Dublin City Centre, making it an ideal location for commuters. A number of Dublin Bus routes also service the area, offering further public transport options.\nIn addition, the property is conveniently located near the N7, providing swift access to the M50 and the wider national road network.\n\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious and well-located home in a popular Dublin suburb.\n\nViewing early is advised"
      },
      {
